          "date": "2026-11-13 05:03:58.000000000",
          "tz": 0
        },
        "subject": "LU-21201 lnet: don't wait for Pushes in ping target update",
        "message": "LU-21201 lnet: don't wait for Pushes in ping target update\n\nlnet_ping_target_update() waits for every reference on the old\nping buffer to drop before it returns. Each Push in flight holds\none, until the Push completes. A Push to a peer that has no\nconnection yet completes only when the LND times it out (49 s by\ndefault) if the connection is not made in time. Each\n\"lnetctl net add\" or \"net del\" then blocks for that long.\n\nconf-sanity test_73c hits this in every CI run. test_73b leaves\nabout 100 configured peers with unreachable NIDs on ost1. Their\ndiscovery pings keep the socklnd connd threads blocked in\nconnect(). The Push of each new ping buffer to a reachable peer\nthat needs a new connection waits in the connd queue until it\ntimes out, and each of the 36 \"net add\" commands takes ~50 s.\n\nThe wait is not needed. The ping buffer is reference counted.\nThe ping MD holds a reference until its unlink event and each\nPush holds one until its MD is unlinked. Whoever drops the last\none frees the buffer, as lnet_push_target_resize() already does\nfor the push target. So unlink the old MD and drop our reference\nwithout waiting. This also removes the ln_api_mutex drop that\nLU-17103 added to avoid a deadlock in that wait.\n\nAn old ping MD that is still sending a GET reply stays linked\nuntil the reply completes. Count the ping target MDs not yet\nunlinked, and have ping target cleanup wait for all of them\nbefore it checks that none is left.\n\nOn a 2-node VM cluster, 73b then 73c as in CI: 73c took 1146 s\nbefore, with 17 net adds of 51-61 s, and 150 s after, about 10 s\nfor all 36 net adds. That is 15-19 minutes of each conf-sanity\nrun, ldiskfs and ZFS. sanity-lnet passes (136 pass, 51 skip),\nincluding test_500 for the LU-17103 deadlock.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity-lnet\nTest-Parameters: testlist=conf-sanity env=ONLY=73\nFixes: 0f1aaad4c1b4 (\"LU-9480 lnet: implement Peer Discovery\")\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I59ba75c6212fa3356f908c6e328bc8de2caf642d\n"
      },
